%% Yole - Text Parsing Pipeline
%% Sequence diagram showing format detection, parsing, and HTML generation

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant App as Platform App
    participant Doc as Document Model
    participant FR as FormatRegistry
    participant PR as ParserRegistry
    participant Parser as TextParser
    participant DC as DocumentCache
    participant PD as ParsedDocument
    participant SS as StyleSheets

    Note over User,SS: File Opening and Format Detection

    User->>App: Open file (e.g., README.md)
    App->>Doc: createDocument(path)
    Doc->>Doc: Extract title, extension

    App->>FR: detectByExtension(".md")
    FR->>FR: Match against 17 format entries

    alt Extension matches single format
        FR-->>App: TextFormat(id="markdown")
    else Extension matches multiple formats (e.g., .txt)
        FR-->>App: First match by priority order
        App->>FR: detectByContent(content, maxLines=10)
        FR->>FR: Test regex detectionPatterns<br/>per format in priority order
        FR-->>App: TextFormat (most specific match)
    else Extension not recognized
        FR-->>App: TextFormat(id="plaintext") [fallback]
    end

    App->>Doc: document.format = detectedFormat.id

    Note over User,SS: Parsing Phase

    App->>PR: getParser(format)
    alt Parser already instantiated
        PR-->>App: Cached TextParser instance
    else Parser registered lazily
        PR->>Parser: factory() -- instantiate on first use
        PR->>PR: Cache parser, remove factory
        PR-->>App: Newly created TextParser
    end

    App->>FR: parseWithCache(content, format)
    FR->>DC: get(contentHash)
    alt Cache hit
        DC-->>FR: Cached ParsedDocument
        FR-->>App: ParsedDocument (from cache)
    else Cache miss
        DC-->>FR: null
        FR->>Parser: parse(content, options)
        Parser->>Parser: Analyze raw markup content
        Parser->>Parser: Extract metadata<br/>(lines, words, headings, etc.)
        Parser->>Parser: Run format-specific validation
        Parser->>PD: Create ParsedDocument(<br/>  format, rawContent,<br/>  parsedContent, metadata, errors<br/>)
        FR->>DC: put(contentHash, ParsedDocument)
        PD-->>App: ParsedDocument
    end

    Note over User,SS: HTML Generation (Lazy + Cached)

    App->>PD: toHtml(lightMode=true)

    alt HTML already cached for this mode
        PD-->>App: Return cached HTML (zero allocation)
    else First call -- generate HTML
        PD->>PR: getParser(format)
        PR-->>PD: TextParser
        PD->>Parser: toHtml(document, lightMode)
        Parser->>SS: getStyleSheet(formatId, lightMode)
        SS-->>Parser: CSS string (light or dark theme)
        Parser->>Parser: Generate HTML body from parsedContent
        Parser-->>PD: Complete HTML (style + body)
        PD->>PD: Cache in _cachedHtmlLight
        PD-->>App: Generated HTML
    end

    Note over User,SS: Subsequent calls return cached HTML instantly

    App->>PD: toHtml(lightMode=true)
    PD-->>App: Cached HTML (no regeneration)

    App->>PD: toHtml(lightMode=false)
    Note over PD: Separate cache for dark mode
    PD->>Parser: toHtml(document, lightMode=false)
    Parser->>SS: getStyleSheet(formatId, lightMode=false)
    SS-->>Parser: Dark theme CSS
    Parser-->>PD: Dark HTML
    PD->>PD: Cache in _cachedHtmlDark
    PD-->>App: Dark mode HTML
